#. module: bf_property_finance
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_finance/models/bf_property_attendance.py:0
msgid ""
"<li>%(owner)s (%(unit)s) : %(amount)s dus, échus depuis le %(since)s</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li>%(owner)s (%(unit)s): %(amount)s due, outstanding since %(since)s</li>"

#. module: bf_property_finance
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_finance/models/bf_property_attendance.py:0
msgid ""
"<p>Art. 1094 C.c.Q. appliqué à %(count)d ligne(s) de présence, sur la foi du"
" registre des impayés : une contribution échue depuis plus de trois mois "
"n'est pas acquittée.</p><ul>%(detail)s</ul><p>Art. 1099 : les voix ainsi "
"retirées viennent en diminution du total des voix du syndicat. Art. 1094 al."
" 2 : le droit revient dès que la totalité des charges dues est "
"acquittée.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Art. 1094 CCQ applied to %(count)d attendance line(s), on the faith of "
"the arrears register: a contribution due for more than three months is "
"unpaid.</p><ul>%(detail)s</ul><p>Art. 1099: the votes thus withdrawn come in"
" reduction of the total votes of the syndicate. Art. 1094 para. 2: the right"
" returns as soon as all the expenses due are paid.</p>"

#. module: bf_property_finance
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_finance/models/bf_property_charge_statement.py:0
msgid ""
"<p>Bonjour,</p><p>%(syndicat)s vous avise, comme l'exige l'art. 1069 al. 2 "
"C.c.Q., qu'un état des charges dues pour la fraction %(unit)s a été demandé "
"le %(date)s par %(requester)s, qui se propose de l'acquérir. Cet état lui "
"sera fourni après le présent avis.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hello,</p><p>As required by art. 1069 para. 2 CCQ, %(syndicat)s notifies "
"you that a statement of common expenses due for fraction %(unit)s was "
"requested on %(date)s by %(requester)s, the prospective acquirer. The "
"statement will be provided to them after this notice.</p>"

#. module: bf_property_finance
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_finance.report_budget
msgid ""
"<strong>Ce que ce tableau dit, et ce qu'il ne dit pas.</strong>\n"
"                            Il suit la contribution : ce qui a été fixé, ce qui a été\n"
"                            appelé aux copropriétaires, ce qui est rentré. Il ne compare\n"
"                            pas le prévu au <em>dépensé</em> : le module ne tient aucune\n"
"                            dépense, ni facture ni comptabilité. L'encaissé est réparti\n"
"                            entre les postes au prorata de l'appelé, parce qu'un paiement\n"
"                            s'impute sur la contribution d'une fraction et non sur un\n"
"                            poste (articles 1569 à 1572 du Code civil)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>What this table says, and what it does not say.</strong>\n"
"                            It follows the contribution: what was fixed, what was\n"
"                            called from the co-owners, what came in. It does not compare\n"
"                            the planned to the <em>spent</em>: the module keeps no\n"
"                            expense, no invoice and no accounting. What was collected is apportioned\n"
"                            among the items in proportion to what was called, because a payment\n"
"                            is imputed to the contribution of a fraction and not to an\n"
"                            item (articles 1569 to 1572 of the Civil Code)."

#. module: bf_property_finance
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_finance.report_charge_statement
msgid ""
"<strong>Projet.</strong>\n"
"                            Cet état n'a pas encore été fourni au proposant acquéreur. Tant\n"
"                            qu'il ne l'est pas, la date portée ci-dessous est celle du jour et\n"
"                            le délai de quinze jours continue de courir."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Draft.</strong>\n"
"                            This statement has not yet been provided to the prospective acquirer. So long\n"
"                            as it is not, the date shown below is today's and\n"
"                            the fifteen-day period continues to run."

