msgstr "Adjustment according to the last annual budget"

#. module: bf_property_finance
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_finance.report_charge_statement
msgid ""
"Alinéa 3 : « L'état fourni est ajusté selon le dernier budget\n"
"                                annuel des copropriétaires. »"
msgstr ""
"Paragraph 3: \"The statement provided is adjusted according to the last\n"
"                                annual budget of the co-owners.\""

