msgstr "On the interest"

#. module: bf_property_finance
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_finance.field_bf_property_organisation__contingency_general_assiette
msgid ""
"Sur quoi porte le 5 % de la Loi 16, art. 153 al. 2, dont le texte vise « les"
" contributions des copropriétaires aux charges communes ». L'art. 1072 "
"C.c.Q. range les versements au fonds de prévoyance et au fonds d'auto-"
"assurance DANS cette contribution, ce qui conduit à prendre le total ; "
"l'usage d'avant la Loi 16 calculait souvent sur le seul budget "
"d'exploitation. Sur 60 000 $ d'exploitation plus 3 000 $ aux fonds, les deux"
" lectures diffèrent de 150 $ par exercice. Question pour le notaire ou "
"l'avocat au dossier. Ne sert que lorsque le plancher retenu est celui de la "
"Loi 16."
msgstr ""
"What the 5% under Act 16, s. 153 para. 2 bears on, its text aiming at \"the "
"co-owners' contributions for common expenses\". Art. 1072 CCQ places the "
"payments into the contingency fund and the self-insurance fund WITHIN that "
"contribution, which leads to taking the total; practice before Act 16 often "
"calculated on the operating budget alone. On $60,000 of operations plus "
"$3,000 into the funds, the two readings differ by $150 per financial period."
" A question for the notary or the lawyer on the file. Used only where the "
"floor retained is the one under Act 16."

