"⚠️ État fourni le %(issued)s, après l'échéance du %(deadline)s. Art. 1069 "
"al. 2 : le proposant acquéreur n'est PAS tenu au paiement de ces charges. Le"
" syndicat a perdu sa créance contre lui et devra la réclamer au vendeur."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ Statement provided on %(issued)s, after the due date of %(deadline)s. "
"Art. 1069 para. 2: the prospective acquirer is NOT bound to pay those "
"expenses. The syndicate has lost its claim against him and will have to "
"claim it from the seller."

