"l'état n'a pas été fourni. Fourni maintenant, il n'obligera plus le "
"proposant acquéreur."
msgstr ""
"🔴 The 15 days under art. 1069 para. 2 have elapsed since %(deadline)s and "
"the statement was not provided. Provided now, it will no longer bind the "
"prospective acquirer."
